ocessing the data (typically legitimate interest for B2B prospecting in the EU), responding to individual rights requests such as access, deletion, or opt-out within 30 days as required by GDPR, maintaining an internal suppression list for individuals who opt out, being transparent with prospects about how you obtained their information, and ensuring that all outreach complies with applicable laws, including GDPR, CAN-SPAM, and CASL.\"}]]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"value\":\"item-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L8\",null,{\"className\":\"px-6 text-base font-semibold text-foreground hover:no-underline hover:bg-muted data-[state=open]:bg-muted\",\"children\":\"How should I respond to individuals asking about their contact information?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"className\":\"px-6 pt-2 text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[\"Since you are the data controller who initiated the enrichment request, you should respond directly to the individual. Example Response:\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"i\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\\"We obtained your professional contact information through a B2B prospecting platform that aggregates publicly available professional data. The information was collected solely from publicly accessible sources, including professional profiles, business directories, and company websites. This processing is conducted under our legitimate interest as a business for B2B communications regarding professional services, in accordance with GDPR Article 6(1)(f).\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"If you prefer not to receive such messages or would like to update your contact preferences, please let us know, and we will promptly process your request, in line with GDPR requirements for responding to data subject rights\\\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"This is general guidance only and not legal advice. We recommend consulting with your legal team to determine the appropriate legal basis for your specific use case\"]}]]}]\ne:[\"